  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"workflow-structural-preload-accepts-duplicate-display-names-",某个 run 引用的 demand fields 存在 duplicate effective field display names,系统执行 structural preload（workflow compile/preload 阶段）,preload MUST 成功返回结构信息
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"rendered-yaml-max-len-is-enforced-during-structural-preload",用户调用 workflow 入口并提供 `template_vars`,structural preload 解析某个包含模板渲染的 demand YAML,"若渲染后 YAML 文本超过该上限，系统 MUST 在 structural preload 阶段 fail-fast"
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"per-run-patches-can-disable-inferable-diagnostics-before-pre",workflow run A 的 demand fields 存在 duplicate effective field display names,系统执行到 preflight 阶段,系统 MUST 将该 run 的 effective policy 视为关闭
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"outputs-override-can-disable-the-duplicate-name-trigger",某个 demand fields 存在 duplicate effective field display names,用户通过 runtime overrides 将 effective outputs 调整为“不写 `header_fields_output_by=name` 的 header”,preflight MUST 认为该检查不触发
  r5,"outputs-override-can-enable-the-duplicate-name-trigger",某个 demand fields 存在 duplicate effective field display names,用户通过 runtime overrides 将 effective outputs 调整为“会写 `header_fields_output_by=name` 的 header”,preflight MUST 认为该检查触发
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"first-failing-run-stops-preflight-immediately",workflow 存在两个 runs，且按 decl_order 都会触发同一个 preflight 错误,系统执行 preflight,系统 MUST 抛出与第一个 run 对应的错误
  r7,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r7,"trigger-semantics-behave-identically-across-preflight-and-ru",同一份 demand 结构与同一份 effective outputs/resources,系统在 preflight 与 runtime compile 两个边界分别判断是否触发某个 inferable check,两处的触发判定 MUST 一致（不得出现一处触发而另一处不触发的 drift）